h fraction arithmetic and covers all the way up through the algebra of linear equations. Upon completing the course, students will be prepared for Mathematical Foundations II, the second step of the journey towards university-level math." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046648 #edb/ref 1009 "Solidify your arithmetic, learn about variables and graphs, level up your algebra, and learn the essentials of geometry." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046648 #edb/ref 1012 113 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046648 #edb/ref 1013 "MF1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046648 #edb/ref 1014 #uuid "042e624c-a46d-509f-a48e-61bd6d3e082c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048546 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049626 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048546 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050452 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048546 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186064354 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048546 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186064355 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048546 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186064356 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048546 #edb/ref 1031 "Adding a Positive Number to a Negative Number" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048546 #edb/ref 1033 329 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048546 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "a8d02ba6-b6bf-5189-bb4e-2eec42cf7133" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048725 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048671 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048725 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048673 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048725 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049986 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048725 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186054781 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048725 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186054782 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048725 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186054783 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048725 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186054784 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048725 #edb/ref 1031 "Solving One-Step Addition and Subtraction Equations" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048725 #ed